#ASSERT `s 21A(1): the person may perform or exercise the duty, obligation, right or power in the same manner and to the same extent as if the person were the holder` TRUE `the office or position of a member, officer or employee of a State authority within the meaning of the State Service Act 2000` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21A(1): the person may perform or exercise the duty, obligation, right or power in the same manner and to the same extent as if the person were the holder` TRUE `a statutory office or any other office or position in the service of the Crown` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21A(1): the person may perform or exercise the duty, obligation, right or power in the same manner and to the same extent as if the person were the holder` TRUE `a statutory office or any other office or position in the service of the Crown` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21A(1): the person may perform or exercise the duty, obligation, right or power in the same manner and to the same extent as if the person were the holder` TRUE `a statutory office or any other office or position in the service of the Crown` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21A(1): the person may perform or exercise the duty, obligation, right or power in the same manner and to the same extent as if the person were the holder` FALSE `a statutory office or any other office or position in the service of the Crown` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21A(1): the person may perform or exercise the duty, obligation, right or power in the same manner and to the same extent as if the person were the holder` TRUE `any other office, position or appointment` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
